WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.108 --> 00:00:21.777
&gt;&gt; Bret: SOME SCHOOLS ARE NOT

00:00:19.808 --> 00:00:22.678
WAITING FOR ANOTHER DISASTER TO

00:00:21.911 --> 00:00:24.180
ACT.

00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:25.881
MATT FINN SHOWS US THEY ARE

00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:26.515
ALREADY GIVING THEIR TEACHERS

00:00:26.015 --> 00:00:31.087
AND THE MEANS TO DEFEND

00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:33.289
THEMSELVES AND THEIR STUDENTS.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:34.490
&gt;&gt; TWO SCHOOL DISTRICTS NEAR

00:00:33.422 --> 00:00:36.025
DAYTON, OHIO, HAVE A

00:00:34.624 --> 00:00:38.327
CONFIDENTIAL TEAM OF TEACHERS

00:00:36.158 --> 00:00:39.595
AND STAFF TRAINED TO FIRE BACK

00:00:38.461 --> 00:00:40.896
