00:00:39.729 --> 00:00:42.098
&gt;&gt; TRAINED TO ADDRESS THE

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:44.166
THREAT, NOT TO RUN AWAY.

00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:48.304
&gt;&gt; THE SCHOOLS TAKE MEASURES TO

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:51.474
CONCEAL THE GUNS THAT ARE HIDDEN

00:00:48.437 --> 00:00:53.075
IN SAFES THAT CAN BE OPENED ONLY

00:00:51.607 --> 00:00:56.078
BY STAFF.

00:00:53.209 --> 00:00:57.546
EACH MEMBER IS VETTED BY THE

00:00:56.212 --> 00:00:59.749
DISTRICT, MUST HAVE A LICENSE TO

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:01.317
CARRY AND ATTEND RIGOROUS

00:00:59.882 --> 00:01:03.486
TRAINING.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:05.521
&gt;&gt; THE TEAM MEMBERS HAVE ACCESS.

00:01:03.619 --> 00:01:07.023
&gt;&gt; MANY STUDENTS SEEM TO SUPPORT

00:01:05.655 --> 00:01:07.490
THE IDEA OF THEIR TEACHERS BEING

00:01:07.256 --> 00:01:08.925
ARMED.

00:01:07.623 --> 00:01:10.393
&gt;&gt; TO HAVE PEOPLE INSIDE THE

00:01:09.058 --> 00:01:11.694
SCHOOL WHO KNOW WHAT THEY ARE

00:01:10.526 --> 00:01:13.896
DOING AND WHO CAN PROTECT US, I

00:01:11.828 --> 00:01:15.865
THINK THAT'S AMAZING.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.499
I DON'T THINK THERE'S ANY ROOM

00:01:15.998 --> 00:01:19.302
FOR COMPLAINTS.

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:19.769
&gt;&gt; INSIDE THOSE FOUR WALLS, THEY

00:01:19.435 --> 00:01:23.506
ARE OUR SAFETY.

00:01:19.902 --> 00:01:24.073
&gt;&gt; BOTH DISTRICTS FACE

00:01:23.639 --> 00:01:25.508
OPPOSITION.

00:01:24.207 --> 00:01:28.211
&gt;&gt; LET THE TEACHERS TEACH.

00:01:25.641 --> 00:01:30.313
&gt;&gt; THE POLICE CHIEF SAYS HE'S

00:01:28.344 --> 00:01:31.714
NOT AGAINST ARMED TEACHERS BUT

00:01:30.446 --> 00:01:32.215
WORRIES COULD INTERFERE WITH HIS

00:01:31.848 --> 00:01:35.251
FIRST RESPONDERS.

00:01:32.348 --> 00:01:38.888
&gt;&gt; ONE OR TWO PEOPLE WITH GUNS

00:01:35.385 --> 00:01:39.989
TO SIX OR SEVEN PEOPLE WITH GUNS

00:01:39.022 --> 00:01:42.292
WITHOUT HAVING ASSURANCE WITH A

00:01:40.123 --> 00:01:45.095
GOOD GUY OR BAD GUY IS.

00:01:42.425 --> 00:01:47.130
&gt;&gt; LEE SHELBY COUNTY SHERIFF

00:01:45.228 --> 00:01:48.898
TELLS FOX NEWS HE DEVELOPED THE

00:01:47.263 --> 00:01:50.133
PLAN WHILE WATCHING SANDY HOOK

00:01:49.032 --> 00:01:50.500
UNFOLD KNOWING HIS GOAL WAS NOT

00:01:50.266 --> 00:01:53.303
PREPARED.

00:01:50.633 --> 00:01:54.704
&gt;&gt; WE CANNOT DEPEND ON THE STATE

00:01:53.436 --> 00:01:58.074
OR FEDERAL GOVERNMENT.

00:01:54.838 --> 00:01:57.107
WE CAN'T DEPEND ON PSYCHOLOGISTS

00:01:57.107 --> 00:01:58.508
WE CAN'T DEPEND ON PSYCHOLOGIST

00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.309
PSYCHOLOGISTS.

00:01:58.641 --> 00:02:01.211
&gt;&gt; THE ARMED SECURITY GUARD SAYS

00:01:59.442 --> 00:02:03.213
EACH STAFF MEMBER WENT THROUGH

00:02:01.344 --> 00:02:04.547
INTENSE TRAINING AND HE

00:02:03.346 --> 00:02:04.881
CONSIDERED THEM CERTIFIED

00:02:04.681 --> 00:02:07.317
BACKUP.

00:02:05.015 --> 00:02:08.518
&gt;&gt; A MINUTE IS A LONG TIME

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.919
SOMETIMES IN A SITUATION WHERE

00:02:08.651 --> 00:02:10.253
YOU ARE DEALING WITH AN ACTIVE

00:02:10.053 --> 00:02:12.789
KILLER.

00:02:10.387 --> 00:02:13.890
&gt;&gt; AS A NATIONAL DEBATE RAGES ON

00:02:12.922 --> 00:02:18.061
