00:02:14.024 --> 00:02:19.262
SHOULD BE ARMED, THAT SCHOOL

00:02:18.194 --> 00:02:21.531
DISTRICTS IN OHIO SAYS IT STANDS

00:02:19.396 --> 00:02:22.365
BY ITS DECISION BECAUSE OF ONE

